      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Car Transport Inspection Checklist: Preparing Your Vehicle for Safe Shifting in Kailasahar</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Ensuring your vehicle arrives in pristine condition begins with rigorous pre-transport inspections. When selecting <strong>Car Transportation In Kailasahar</strong>, understanding these three critical checks helps you verify that the carrier has adhered to industry best practices. These steps are standard for top-tier vehicle transport services, ensuring accountability and minimizing liability disputes during transit.</p>

<h3>1. Fluid Levels Verification</h3>
<p>Fluids can leak or shift during long hauls, potentially causing mechanical damage. Before the vehicle is loaded, the transport team must verify the integrity of essential systems. This step prevents engine failure and ensures the car is road-ready upon delivery.</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
