<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Kailasahar 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Car Transportation In Kailasahar safe with Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our safety protocol combines a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, custom wooden crates for fragile components, hydraulic ramp trailers with wheel chocks, and IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. Real‑time GPS tracking and 24/7 CCTV surveillance ensure every vehicle reaches its destination without a single scratch, fulfilling our zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for Car Transportation In Kailasahar calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price is derived from a transparent formula that includes base mileage (per km), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, packaging material costs, and any optional services like door‑to‑door delivery. Our online Get Kailasahar Shifting Quote tool instantly breaks down each component, so you know exactly what you’re paying for before the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need any special documents for car transport from Kailasahar to other cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Required documents include a valid vehicle registration certificate, owner’s ID proof, GST invoice, e‑Way bill for interstate movement, and the IBA‑approved mover code certificate. Additionally, we provide an IRDAI‑approved marine insurance policy that must be signed before loading. Having these ready speeds up clearance at checkpoints.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my car by train instead of road transport from Kailasahar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Car shifting by train is an alternative offered across India, but it involves longer transit times, limited loading windows, and additional handling that may increase the risk of minor dents. Enclosed vehicle shipping on our hydraulic ramp trailers provides door‑to‑door service, faster delivery, and a zero‑scratch guarantee, making it the preferred choice for most customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I check on my vehicle before the transport inspection checklist?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Before loading, verify that all fluid levels (oil, coolant, brake fluid) are topped up, tire pressure is at the recommended level, and the battery terminals are clean. Document any existing scratches or dents with photographs, remove personal items, and ensure the fuel tank is no more than a quarter full to comply with safety regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the zero‑scratch guarantee work during Car Transportation In Kailasahar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our guarantee is backed by a multi‑layer protection strategy: each vehicle is wrapped in 80‑GSM bubble wrap, secured with high‑density foam edge protectors, and placed on a hydraulic ramp trailer with wheel chocks. In the unlikely event of damage, our comprehensive insurance covers repair costs, and we promptly address any claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a way to track my car while it’s being transported from Kailasahar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every Shree Ashirwad truck is equipped with satellite GPS and live tracking capabilities. You receive a unique tracking link that lets you monitor the vehicle’s exact location in real time, ensuring full transparency throughout the journey from pickup to delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
